Below you’ll find a **starter‑kit** for a small but production‑ready *Trucking Transportation Management System* (TMS).  
It’s split into two parts – backend (Node + Express + Prisma) and frontend (React/Vite).  

> ⚠️ **What this repo gives you**
>
> - Core domain entities (`Truck`, `Driver`, `Shipment`, …)
> - RESTful CRUD endpoints with validation & auth
> - Basic business logic (assign driver → truck → route)
> - Simple dashboard UI (list / detail / create)

Feel free to copy/paste the folders below into your own project, then tweak the schemas, services or UI to match your exact requirements.



--------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1️⃣ Backend – Node + Prisma + Express (TypeScript)

```
tms-backend/
├─ package.json
├─ tsconfig.json
├─ .env.example
├─ prisma/
│   └─ schema.prisma          ← DB definition
└─ src/
    ├─ index.ts               ← Server bootstrap
    ├─ db.ts                  ← Prisma client singleton
    ├─ middleware/
    │   ├─ auth.ts            ← JWT guard
    │   └─ errorHandler.ts
    ├─ routes/
    │   ├─ auth.routes.ts
    │   ├─ truck.routes.ts
    │   ├─ driver.routes.ts
    │   ├─ shipment.routes.ts
    │   └─ maintenance.routes.ts
    ├─ controllers/
    │   ├─ auth.controller.ts
    │   ├─ truck.controller.ts
    │   ├─ driver.controller.ts
    │   ├─ shipment.controller.ts
    │   └─ maintenance.controller.ts
    ├─ services/
    │   ├─ truck.service.ts
    │   ├─ driver.service.ts
    │   ├─ shipment.service.ts
    │   └─ maintenance.service.ts
    └─ utils/
        └─ validator.ts       ← Joi/Zod validators
```

